---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Silk Road Wonders Reviews — What Our Customers Say" description="Read authentic reviews from 20,000+ Silk Road travelers. 5-star ratings from travelers worldwide — Italy, Malaysia, Canada, Germany, USA, Singapore and more." ogImage="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg">
<section class="page-hero" style="background: url('/assets/images/xinjiang-landscape.jpg') center/cover;">
  <div class="container"><h1>Customer Reviews</h1><p>Read what 20,000+ travelers say about their Silk Road experience</p></div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://silkroadwondertours.com/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Reviews" }
  ]
}
</script>
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>Reviews</span></div></nav>

<!-- REVIEW STATS -->
<section class="section" style="padding-bottom:0;"><div class="container">
<div class="stats-grid reveal">
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">20,000+</div><div class="stat-label">Happy Travelers</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">4.9/5</div><div class="stat-label">Average Rating</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">99%</div><div class="stat-label">Satisfaction Rate</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">50+</div><div class="stat-label">Countries</div></div>
</div></div></section>

<!-- REVIEWS GRID -->
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-header reveal"><h2>What Our Travelers Say</h2><div class="divider"></div><p>Authentic reviews from travelers around the world</p></div>
<div class="review-page-grid">

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Thanks to the team for making our journey safe and unforgettable. The 14-day Silk Road tour exceeded all expectations — from the Terracotta Warriors in Xi'an to the stunning landscapes of Xinjiang. Every detail was perfectly arranged. Special mention to our guide Tim who brought history to life with his incredible storytelling."</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--clay);">P</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Paola</span><span class="review-author-country">Italy &middot; Silk Road Explorer &middot; May 2026</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Special thanks to Alice for her professional arrangements. Our guides Harry and Jane were incredibly knowledgeable and friendly. The itinerary was perfectly balanced — we saw the Mogao Caves, rode camels in Dunhuang, and explored the Sunday Bazaar in Kashgar. As a Malaysian traveler, having halal food options arranged throughout the trip was a wonderful touch."</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--gold);">J</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Jenny Tang</span><span class="review-author-country">Malaysia &middot; Family Tour &middot; May 2026</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"The Silk Road train journey was the trip of a lifetime! Penny arranged everything flawlessly — from comfortable train cabins to seamless hotel check-ins. The itinerary was well-planned and the natural scenery at Sijin Lacuo was absolutely breathtaking. We appreciated the flexibility to adjust our schedule when we wanted to spend more time photographing the Rainbow Mountains."</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--clay);">D</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Dr Chua</span><span class="review-author-country">Malaysia &middot; Train Adventure &middot; May 2026</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Amazing 13-day Xinjiang + Silk Road tour! Our guide Ali was exceptional — his knowledge of history and genuine care for every traveler made this journey extraordinary. From hiking in Kanas Nature Reserve to tasting local cuisine in Urumqi, every moment was memorable. The sunset over the Flaming Mountains was pure magic. Highly recommended for Canadian travelers!"</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--navy);">A</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Amy</span><span class="review-author-country">Canada &middot; 13-Day Tour &middot; Oct 2025</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Everything went smoothly as planned. The Silk Road exceeded all our expectations — we were particularly impressed by the ancient city of Jiaohe and the vast Gobi Desert landscapes. The accommodations were excellent, especially the boutique hotels in Dunhuang and Turpan. We're already planning our next visit to explore the Central Asia extension!"</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--gold);">H</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Hans</span><span class="review-author-country">Germany &middot; Cultural Tour &middot; Aug 2025</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Thank you Alice and assistant Richard for all the help! As first-time travelers to China from the USA, we were nervous about the language barrier, but you made everything seamless. The private guide was with us throughout, and the driver was always punctual and safe. The whole experience felt like traveling with old friends rather than a tour company."</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--clay);">Q</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Quang & Michelle</span><span class="review-author-country">USA &middot; Private Tour &middot; Sep 2025</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"As a Singaporean who loves photography, the Silk Road was a paradise! John designed a photography-focused itinerary that took us to the best locations at the perfect times — sunrise at Crescent Lake, sunset at the Grand Bazaar. The logistics were flawless, and having a guide who understood photography made all the difference. Already recommending to my camera club!"</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--navy);">J</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Jason</span><span class="review-author-country">Singapore &middot; Photography Tour &middot; Apr 2025</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="review-page-card reveal">
    <div class="review-page-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
    <div class="review-page-body">"Traveling with my elderly parents, I was initially worried about the pace and accessibility. Silk Road Wonders customized the itinerary perfectly — comfortable vehicles, hotels with elevators, and guides who were patient and attentive. The highlight was visiting the Id Kah Mosque in Kashgar during Ramadan. Thank you for a meaningful and stress-free family holiday."</div>
    <div class="review-page-author">
      <div class="review-avatar-circle" style="background:var(--gold);">F</div>
      <div><span class="review-author-name">Fatimah</span><span class="review-author-country">Malaysia &middot; Senior-Friendly Tour &middot; Mar 2025</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div></div></section>

<!-- SUBMIT REVIEW -->
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-header reveal"><h2>Share Your Experience</h2><div class="divider"></div><p>We'd love to hear about your Silk Road journey!</p></div>
<div class="review-form-wrap reveal">
  <h3>Write a Review</h3>
  <form id="reviewForm" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="Review Submission">
    <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label for="reviewName">Your Name *</label><input type="text" id="reviewName" name="name" required></div><div class="form-group"><label for="reviewEmail">Email *</label><input type="email" id="reviewEmail" name="email" required></div></div>
    <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label for="reviewCountry">Country</label><input type="text" id="reviewCountry" name="nationality" placeholder="e.g. USA, Germany..."></div><div class="form-group"><label for="reviewTour">Tour Taken</label><input type="text" id="reviewTour" name="tour" placeholder="e.g. 13-Day Silk Road"></div></div>
    <div class="form-group"><label>Rating</label>
      <div class="star-select">
        <input type="radio" id="star5" name="rating" value="5"><label for="star5" title="5 stars">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star4" name="rating" value="4"><label for="star4" title="4 stars">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star3" name="rating" value="3"><label for="star3" title="3 stars">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star2" name="rating" value="2"><label for="star2" title="2 stars">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star1" name="rating" value="1"><label for="star1" title="1 star">★</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group"><label for="reviewMessage">Your Review *</label><textarea id="reviewMessage" name="message" required placeholder="Tell us about your experience..."></textarea></div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary form-submit">Submit Review</button>
  </form>
</div></div></section>

<section class="cta-section"><div class="container"><div class="cta-grid">
  <div class="cta-text reveal"><h2>Ready to Start?</h2><p>Join 20,000+ happy travelers and experience the Silk Road with us.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us Today</a></div>
</div></div></section>
<CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>